WEBVTT

00:00.080 --> 00:01.680
If I concede today

00:02.160 --> 00:03.120
In the future

00:03.200 --> 00:04.920
How can I govern the state?

00:05.000 --> 00:06.320
Order the city defense forces

00:06.480 --> 00:07.880
To hold firm

00:07.960 --> 00:09.960
Must hold until General Zu Yue arrives

00:10.040 --> 00:11.240
Yes

00:18.000 --> 00:38.000
In the twenty-first year of Longwu, Sikong Xu succeeded to the throne as Emperor. Yet owing to his tender age, he could only rely upon the Xie clan, reigning for a few years...
